#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/docker.md:1
msgid "Docker & Containers"
msgstr "Docker 与容器"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/docker.md:5
msgid ""
"**Image availability is not guaranteed by the Python package.** The "
"`Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` and published images live in the "
"repository, not in the PyPI package. Confirm that `docker pull "
"pygeofetch/pygeofetch:latest` succeeds before relying on it in CI/CD. If it "
"does not, build from source as shown below."
msgstr ""
"**Python 包不保证镜像可用。** `Dockerfile`、`docker-compose.yml` 和已发布的镜像位于仓库中，而不在 PyPI"
" 包中。在 CI/CD 中依赖它之前，请确认 `docker pull pygeofetch/pygeofetch:latest` "
"能成功执行。如果不能，请按下文所示从源码构建。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/docker.md:10
msgid "Quick start with the published image"
msgstr "使用已发布镜像快速开始"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/docker.md:34
msgid "Docker Compose for scheduled pipelines"
msgstr "用于计划流水线的 Docker Compose"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/docker.md:55
msgid ""
"**Credentials are not read from environment variables** such as "
"`PYGEOFETCH_PLANET_API_KEY`, `PYGEOFETCH_COPERNICUS_USERNAME` or "
"`PYGEOFETCH_COPERNICUS_PASSWORD`. No such mechanism exists. The general "
"settings variables above (`PYGEOFETCH_GENERAL__LOG_LEVEL` and similar) are "
"read by `Settings`, which only the `config` commands use (see "
"[Configuration](configuration.md)). Supply credentials by mounting "
"`~/.pygeofetch` or by calling `add_credentials()` at start-up."
msgstr ""
"**不会从环境变量读取凭据**，例如 "
"`PYGEOFETCH_PLANET_API_KEY`、`PYGEOFETCH_COPERNICUS_USERNAME` 或 "
"`PYGEOFETCH_COPERNICUS_PASSWORD`。不存在这样的机制。上面的通用设置变量（`PYGEOFETCH_GENERAL__LOG_LEVEL`"
" 等）由 `Settings` 读取，而只有 `config` 命令使用它（参见[配置](configuration.md)）。请通过挂载 "
"`~/.pygeofetch` 或在启动时调用 `add_credentials()` 来提供凭据。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/docker.md:72
msgid ""
"`PLANET_API_KEY`/`COPERNICUS_USER`/`COPERNICUS_PASS` here are your own "
"environment variable names (populated by Compose's `${VAR}` substitution "
"from your `.env` file or CI secrets, same as before) — your own setup code "
"reads them, not pygeofetch automatically."
msgstr ""
"此处的 `PLANET_API_KEY`/`COPERNICUS_USER`/`COPERNICUS_PASS` 是您自己的环境变量名称（由 "
"Compose 的 `${VAR}` 替换从您的 `.env` 文件或 CI 密钥中填充，与之前相同）— 由您自己的设置代码读取它们，而不是 "
"pygeofetch 自动读取。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/docker.md:89
msgid ""
"Given the default credential storage caveat in [Security "
"Model](security.md), the encrypted-file backend (`auth_backend=\"file\"`, "
"already the real default) combined with a mounted `~/.pygeofetch` volume, as"
" shown above, is the straightforward path for headless container use -- "
"there's no environment-variable credential path to prefer instead, per the "
"correction above."
msgstr ""
"鉴于[安全模型](security.md)中提到的默认凭据存储注意事项，加密文件后端（`auth_backend=\"file\"`，本来就是真正的默认值）结合如上所示挂载的"
" `~/.pygeofetch` 卷，是无头容器使用的直接途径 -- 根据上面的更正，并不存在更值得优先选择的环境变量凭据途径。"
